flowchart TB
  Key[Candidate shard key] --> Card{High cardinality?}
  Card -->|no| Reject[Reject: jumbo/hot chunks]
  Card -->|yes| Mono{Monotonic writes?}
  Mono -->|yes| HashOrCompound[Hash or compound with entropy]
  Mono -->|no| Query{Hot queries include key?}
  Query -->|no| Redesign[Change key or duplicate collection]
  Query -->|yes| Adopt[Adopt + load-test distribution]

